{"id":"7-2-1","courseId":"7","chapterNumber":"2.1","title":"Bokstavregning","description":"Addere, subtrahere, multiplisere uttrykk.","estimatedMinutes":40,"exercises":[],"competenceGoals":["bruke variablar og formlar til å uttrykkje samanhengar i praktiske situasjonar"],"content":[{"id":"7-2-1-intro","type":"text","content":"## Hva er bokstavregning?\n\nI algebra bruker vi bokstaver for å representere ukjente tall eller tall som kan variere. Dette kalles **variabler**.\n\n**Eksempel:** Hvis en boks koster $x$ kroner, koster 3 bokser $3 \\cdot x = 3x$ kroner."},{"id":"7-2-1-def","type":"definition","title":"Algebraiske uttrykk","content":"Et **algebraisk uttrykk** inneholder tall og bokstaver (variabler).\n\n**Eksempler:**\n- $3x$ betyr $3 \\cdot x$\n- $2a + 5$ betyr \"to ganger a pluss fem\"\n- $xy$ betyr $x \\cdot y$\n\n**Merk:** Vi skriver ikke gangetegnet mellom tall og bokstav, eller mellom bokstaver."},{"id":"7-2-1-ledd","type":"text","content":"## Like ledd\n\n**Like ledd** er ledd som har samme bokstavdel. Bare like ledd kan legges sammen.\n\n- $3x$ og $5x$ er like ledd (begge har $x$)\n- $2x$ og $2y$ er IKKE like ledd\n- $4x^2$ og $3x$ er IKKE like ledd"},{"id":"7-2-1-example-1","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 1: Forenkle uttrykk","problem":"Forenkle: $4x + 3y + 2x - y$","solution":"**Løsning:**\nSamle like ledd:\n- $x$-ledd: $4x + 2x = 6x$\n- $y$-ledd: $3y - y = 2y$\n\n$$4x + 3y + 2x - y = 6x + 2y$$\n\n**Svar:** $6x + 2y$"},{"id":"7-2-1-ex-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-2-1-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Forenkle uttrykkene","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$5x + 3x$","solution":"$8x$"},{"label":"b","task":"$7a - 4a$","solution":"$3a$"},{"label":"c","task":"$2x + 4y + 3x$","solution":"$5x + 4y$"},{"label":"d","task":"$6b - 2b + 3b$","solution":"$7b$"}],"solution":"a) 8x, b) 3a, c) 5x + 4y, d) 7b","hints":["Bare like ledd kan legges sammen"]}},{"id":"7-2-1-ex-extra-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-2-1-ex-extra-1","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Forenkle uttrykkene","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$3x + 5x$","solution":"$8x$","expressionAnswer":"8x"},{"label":"b","task":"$7a - 2a$","solution":"$5a$","expressionAnswer":"5a"},{"label":"c","task":"$4x + 2y - x$","solution":"$3x + 2y$","expressionAnswer":"3x+2y"},{"label":"d","task":"$6n - n$","solution":"$5n$ (husk: $n = 1n$)","expressionAnswer":"5n"}],"solution":"a) 8x, b) 5a, c) 3x + 2y, d) 5n","hints":["Bare ledd med samme bokstav kan slås sammen"]}},{"id":"7-2-1-mult","type":"text","content":"## Multiplikasjon med variabler\n\nNår vi ganger uttrykk, ganger vi tallene for seg og bokstavene for seg.\n\n**Eksempler:**\n- $3 \\cdot 4x = 12x$\n- $2x \\cdot 5x = 10x^2$\n- $3a \\cdot 2b = 6ab$"},{"id":"7-2-1-ex-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-2-1-ex-2","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$4 \\cdot 3x$","solution":"$12x$"},{"label":"b","task":"$2x \\cdot 3x$","solution":"$6x^2$"},{"label":"c","task":"$5a \\cdot 4b$","solution":"$20ab$"},{"label":"d","task":"$3x \\cdot 2y \\cdot x$","solution":"$6x^2y$"}],"solution":"a) 12x, b) $6x^2$, c) 20ab, d) $6x^2y$","hints":["Gang tallene, gang bokstavene"]}},{"id":"7-2-1-ex-extra-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-2-1-ex-extra-2","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$3 \\cdot 2x$","solution":"$6x$","expressionAnswer":"6x"},{"label":"b","task":"$x \\cdot x$","solution":"$x^2$","expressionAnswer":"x^2"},{"label":"c","task":"$5 \\cdot 3y$","solution":"$15y$","expressionAnswer":"15y"},{"label":"d","task":"$2x \\cdot 3x$","solution":"$6x^2$","expressionAnswer":"6x^2"}],"solution":"a) 6x, b) x², c) 15y, d) 6x²","hints":["x · x blir x²"]}},{"id":"7-2-1-innsetting","type":"text","content":"## Sette inn verdier\n\nVi kan finne verdien av et uttrykk ved å sette inn tall for variablene.\n\n**Eksempel:** Finn verdien av $3x + 5$ når $x = 4$\n\n$$3x + 5 = 3 \\cdot 4 + 5 = 12 + 5 = 17$$"},{"id":"7-2-1-ex-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-2-1-ex-3","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Finn verdien av uttrykkene når $x = 3$ og $y = 2$","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$4x + 1$","solution":"$13$"},{"label":"b","task":"$2x + 3y$","solution":"$12$"},{"label":"c","task":"$x^2 - y$","solution":"$7$"},{"label":"d","task":"$xy + x$","solution":"$9$"}],"solution":"a) 13, b) 12, c) 7, d) 9","hints":["Bytt ut $x$ med 3 og $y$ med 2, og regn ut"]}},{"id":"7-2-1-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Like ledd**: Ledd med samme variabel kan slås sammen: $4x + 2x = 6x$, men $4x + 3y$ kan ikke forenkles mer.\n- **Multiplikasjon med variabler**: $3 \\cdot 2x = 6x$ og $x \\cdot x = x^2$.\n- **Sette inn verdier**: Bytt ut variablene med tall og regn ut.\n\n### Husk!\n- $x$ betyr $1x$\n- Tall og variabel ganges hver for seg: $3x \\cdot 4x = 12x^2$\n- Bare LIKE ledd kan legges sammen"},{"id":"7-2-1-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgaver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgaver","content":[{"id":"7-2-1-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-2-1-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Forenkle uttrykkene","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$2x + 9x$","solution":"$11x$","expressionAnswer":"11x"},{"label":"b","task":"$8y - 3y$","solution":"$5y$","expressionAnswer":"5y"},{"label":"c","task":"$5a + 2 + 3a$","solution":"$8a + 2$","expressionAnswer":"8a+2"},{"label":"d","task":"$10x - 4x + x$","solution":"$7x$","expressionAnswer":"7x"}],"solution":"a) 11x, b) 5y, c) 8a + 2, d) 7x","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Slå sammen leddene med samme bokstav"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"7-2-1-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-2-1-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$4 \\cdot 3x$","solution":"$12x$","expressionAnswer":"12x"},{"label":"b","task":"$2x \\cdot 5$","solution":"$10x$","expressionAnswer":"10x"},{"label":"c","task":"$x \\cdot x \\cdot x$","solution":"$x^3$","expressionAnswer":"x^3"},{"label":"d","task":"$3x \\cdot 4x$","solution":"$12x^2$","expressionAnswer":"12x^2"}],"solution":"a) 12x, b) 10x, c) x³, d) 12x²","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Gang tallene for seg og variablene for seg"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"7-2-1-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-2-1-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Finn verdien når $x = 5$ og $y = 2$","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$3x + y$","solution":"$15 + 2 = 17$","answer":17},{"label":"b","task":"$x^2 - 5$","solution":"$25 - 5 = 20$","answer":20},{"label":"c","task":"$2x - 3y$","solution":"$10 - 6 = 4$","answer":4},{"label":"d","task":"$xy + 10$","solution":"$10 + 10 = 20$","answer":20}],"solution":"a) 17, b) 20, c) 4, d) 20","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Sett inn tallene og følg regnerekkefølgen"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"7-2-1-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"7-2-1-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Uttrykk i praksis","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Forenkle $2x + 3y - x + 4y$","solution":"$x + 7y$","expressionAnswer":"x+7y"},{"label":"b","task":"Et rektangel har sidene $x$ og $3$. Skriv et uttrykk for omkretsen.","solution":"$2x + 2 \\cdot 3 = 2x + 6$","expressionAnswer":"2x+6"},{"label":"c","task":"Hva er omkretsen når $x = 7$?","solution":"$14 + 6 = 20$","answer":20},{"label":"d","task":"Tre venner har $x$, $x + 5$ og $2x$ kr. Skriv et uttrykk for hvor mye de har til sammen.","solution":"$x + x + 5 + 2x = 4x + 5$","expressionAnswer":"4x+5"}],"solution":"a) x + 7y, b) 2x + 6, c) 20, d) 4x + 5","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Samle like ledd til slutt"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}]}